<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Price REIT rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Price REIT rated a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Bros analyst Jordan Heller said in a research note that he initiated acoverage of Price REIT Inc with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 to 37-5/8 in late morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
